	)
	(text "SHEET INDEX\n  1  Root — overview & block diagram\n  2  Power — 5 V input, TVS, TLV76733 LDO, power LEDs,\n            status LEDs, buzzer, 5 V monitor, test points\n  3  MCU — STM32G0B1KBT6, 8 MHz oscillator, decoupling, reset\n  4  CAN_M2 — SN65HVD230, ESD, termination, M.2 card edge\n  5  Datasheets — every part with clickable datasheet links\n\nKEY SPECIFICATIONS\n  Supply ........ +5V in 4.75–5.25 V: ≈ 40 mA typ,\n                  ≤ 240 mA worst → carrier ≥ 300 mA/module\n  Ambient ....... −20…+70 °C (LDO TJ ≤ 92 °C)\n  3V3 rail ...... TLV76733, 1 A, thermal shutdown;\n                  148 mA worst incl. 50 mA for the carrier\n  MCU ........... STM32G0B1KBT6, 64 MHz,\n                  128 KB Flash / 144 KB RAM\n  CAN ........... FDCAN2, 500 kbit/s, CANopen, ESD-protected\n  Clock ......... 8 MHz XO (±53 ppm worst) → PLL 64 MHz\n  Protection .... SMF6.0A TVS on +5V, NUP2105L on CAN\n  LEDs .......... red 5V · green 3V3 · white CAN · yellow USR\n  Buzzer ........ KLJ-5018 passive 5 V, 90 dB (PB7 4 kHz PWM)\n  Debug ......... SWD + VCP (USART1) → ST-Link V3MINIE\n  USB ........... wired to fingers 23/25, not used\n  Carrier I/O ... 14 GPIO + I2C1 + 3V3 out (≤ 50 mA)\n  PCB ........... M.2 2242 B-key, 4-layer 0.8 mm\n                  JLC04081H-3313, ENIG, bevelled fingers\n  Layers ........ Top Signal / GND Plane / 3V3 Plane /\n                  Bottom Signal\n  Parts ......... 40 parts: 5 JLC Extended (U1 X1 U2 BZ1 D1),\n                  2 Preferred (U3, D2), rest Basic\n\nREVISION HISTORY  (Rev A = not yet fabricated)\n   d1 2026-10-07 Aaron  From-scratch redesign of MES3\n   d2 2026-10-07 Aaron  Datasheet pinout pass, all nets\n                        named, Basic LEDs, USB_DN pair\n   d3 2026-10-07 Aaron  Review 1: active buzzer, R14 on\n                        HSE, C2/C5 sizes, carrier rules\n   d4 2026-10-08 Aaron  Review 2: TLV76733 LDO, D2 D_SMF,\n                        R7 0603, R8 20k, R12 4.7k, R15/R16\n                        at U3, carrier rules, USB unused\n   d5 2026-10-13 Aaron  Smaller buzzer: KLJ-5018-5040\n                        5.5 mm passive, 4 kHz PWM on PB7\n   d6 2026-10-14 Aaron  U1 → STM32G0B1KBT6 (LQFP-32):\n                        KBU6 out of stock; review fixes\n\nCarrier spec: MES4-CIF = CARRIER_INTERFACE.md (rev A-d6)"
